WEBVTT

00:02:06.090 --> 00:02:08.960
The rematch you've been
talking about for so long...

00:02:09.360 --> 00:02:11.630
If you win the match...

00:02:11.690 --> 00:02:13.630
I'll back down quietly.

00:02:14.000 --> 00:02:14.830
But...

00:02:14.930 --> 00:02:17.270
if I win...

00:02:17.870 --> 00:02:19.000
Go out with me.

00:02:22.170 --> 00:02:23.410
Hey, Miyao.

00:02:24.510 --> 00:02:28.510
So... this girl asked me out.

00:02:29.580 --> 00:02:33.280
She's like a friend
I get along with really well.

00:02:34.180 --> 00:02:35.080
Is it Hidaka?

00:02:35.280 --> 00:02:36.420
Huh? How'd you...

00:02:37.020 --> 00:02:40.760
A neighborhood girl you get along with
who asked you out?

00:02:40.820 --> 00:02:41.960
It has to be her.

00:02:43.160 --> 00:02:45.530
I see. So, Hidaka finally did it.

00:02:45.590 --> 00:02:46.500
Finally?

00:02:47.100 --> 00:02:51.430
She's only had eyes for you
since junior high.

00:02:51.970 --> 00:02:55.340
I see... I had no idea.

00:02:55.570 --> 00:02:56.870
What are you gonna do?

00:02:57.040 --> 00:03:00.240
-Well, she gave me a condition.
-A condition?

00:03:01.140 --> 00:03:04.550
The fighting game rematch
I've been bugging her for...

00:03:04.910 --> 00:03:07.280
She said if I win, she'll back down.

00:03:07.850 --> 00:03:11.520
But if she wins, she wants us to go out.

00:03:12.990 --> 00:03:15.760
There's no way I can accept
a condition like that.

00:03:16.530 --> 00:03:19.360
But I can't just pretend it didn't happen.

00:03:19.830 --> 00:03:24.930
Your best move is to tell her
who you like and turn her down.

00:03:25.370 --> 00:03:27.040
You are into someone, right, Haruo?

00:03:27.770 --> 00:03:29.810
<i>I know you do, Haruo!</i>

00:03:30.240 --> 00:03:33.780
<i>A girl I like? Who do I like? Who do I...</i>

00:03:34.310 --> 00:03:35.510
Do I like anyone?

00:03:35.680 --> 00:03:37.110
<i>I can't believe you.</i>

00:03:37.350 --> 00:03:40.120
<i>You still haven't realized </i>
<i>your own feelings.</i>

00:03:40.350 --> 00:03:44.750
<i>Geez, Hidaka must have confessed </i>
<i>her feelings out of frustration.</i>

00:03:47.590 --> 00:03:51.390
Haruo, you should accept
Hidaka's challenge.

00:03:52.230 --> 00:03:55.700
She's made up her mind. You should, too.

00:03:57.630 --> 00:03:58.670
You're right.

00:04:16.150 --> 00:04:18.890
Did you catch a cold, Miss Makoto?

00:04:18.950 --> 00:04:22.290
You should cover your mouth
when you sneeze.

00:04:22.360 --> 00:04:23.830
It's impolite otherwise.

00:04:26.800 --> 00:04:28.900
It's been so hot lately.

00:04:29.000 --> 00:04:31.330
The next thing I know,
I'm sleeping in my birthday suit.

00:04:31.400 --> 00:04:33.200
I must have caught it then.

00:04:33.270 --> 00:04:35.670
I was unconscious, so it's not my fault!

00:04:35.740 --> 00:04:39.370
Still it's important to have
a little more decorum...

00:04:39.440 --> 00:04:41.340
-Oh!
-Miss!

00:04:41.780 --> 00:04:44.250
My dear baby sister, Akira.

00:04:44.310 --> 00:04:47.820
Were you forced to come straight home
today, too? My poor girl.

00:04:47.880 --> 00:04:50.620
I can't believe you were out all night!

00:04:50.720 --> 00:04:53.520
Who would've thought you'd beat me to it.

00:04:53.590 --> 00:04:54.620
Miss Makoto!

00:04:55.160 --> 00:04:59.490
Miss Akira has to attend
many lessons shortly.

00:04:59.830 --> 00:05:01.430
Aww, that's no fun.

00:05:01.500 --> 00:05:03.500
What about your college, Miss Makoto?

00:05:03.570 --> 00:05:05.070
It's already summer break.

00:05:05.130 --> 00:05:06.770
I'm so bored, I'm going crazy!

00:05:07.200 --> 00:05:10.570
<i>Despite being the eldest </i>
<i>of the Ono siblings,</i>

00:05:10.640 --> 00:05:12.510
<i>she's a natural born troublemaker.</i>

00:05:12.840 --> 00:05:17.780
<i>The younger sister's strict upbringing may</i>
<i>be backlash due to her older sister.</i>

00:05:18.310 --> 00:05:21.780
By the way, have you seen Ms. Goda?

00:05:22.020 --> 00:05:23.720
She said she's stepping out.

00:05:23.790 --> 00:05:27.690
What was it? She said something about
going to see some little bug...

00:05:31.360 --> 00:05:37.370
<i>Talking to Miyao helped, </i>
<i>but I have to decide what to do.</i>

00:05:37.630 --> 00:05:38.870
I'm home.

00:05:40.700 --> 00:05:42.170
Welcome back, Haruo.

00:05:42.400 --> 00:05:45.710
Ms. Goda from the Ono's is here.

00:05:46.470 --> 00:05:47.380
Hello.

00:05:47.780 --> 00:05:51.380
She's here to thank you
regarding that incident with Akira.

00:05:51.950 --> 00:05:56.520
The sweets Ms. Goda brought
are so delicious.

00:05:57.050 --> 00:05:58.290
Mr. Haruo.

00:05:58.350 --> 00:06:02.320
I apologize for the trouble we put
you through the other day.

00:06:02.860 --> 00:06:03.960
N-Not at all.

00:06:04.030 --> 00:06:06.260
Something about her doesn't feel right.

00:06:06.660 --> 00:06:09.730
We hear of so much tragic news nowadays.

00:06:09.870 --> 00:06:12.230
The world's become a
noticeably more dangerous place.

00:06:12.300 --> 00:06:16.070
When I heard Miss Akira's friend
Mr. Haruo was with her,

00:06:16.140 --> 00:06:17.510
I was much relieved.

00:06:18.270 --> 00:06:21.210
I should have come to thank you earlier.

00:06:21.280 --> 00:06:23.180
I'm truly grateful.

00:06:23.250 --> 00:06:24.980
Don't worry about it.

00:06:25.810 --> 00:06:27.350
Oh, it's starting to rain!

00:06:27.420 --> 00:06:29.420
The laundry is hanging out there!

00:06:29.520 --> 00:06:31.090
Excuse me for a moment!

00:06:33.190 --> 00:06:34.290
Mr. Haruo.

00:06:34.390 --> 00:06:38.030
I did not come here today
simply to thank you.

00:06:38.490 --> 00:06:40.400
I came to see you.

00:06:40.460 --> 00:06:41.400
E-Excuse me?

00:06:41.760 --> 00:06:43.970
Let me be blunt.

00:06:44.030 --> 00:06:48.670
I want you to cut off all ties
with Miss Akira as of today.

00:06:49.370 --> 00:06:50.240
Huh?

00:06:50.640 --> 00:06:54.140
Miss Akira is making an effort
to live by the Ono family rules.

00:06:54.210 --> 00:06:58.210
However, as a still emotionally
susceptible high school student,

00:06:58.280 --> 00:07:01.480
I don't want any unnecessary
influence affecting her.

00:07:03.490 --> 00:07:07.090
Akira and you have
a male-female relationship.

00:07:07.260 --> 00:07:10.630
I won't let your youthful drive cause
any problems for her.

00:07:11.390 --> 00:07:12.430
<i>Haruo.</i>

00:07:12.590 --> 00:07:15.500
<i>Tell her your relationship with her </i>
<i>means more than that.</i>

00:07:15.560 --> 00:07:16.770
<i>Give it to her straight!</i>

00:07:16.930 --> 00:07:17.770
<i>Haruo!</i>

00:07:18.200 --> 00:07:20.770
You are nothing but
a nuisance to Miss Akira.

00:07:21.270 --> 00:07:24.240
You are dragging her down!

00:07:27.310 --> 00:07:30.250
I want you to end
your involvement with her.

00:07:32.680 --> 00:07:34.220
I'm so sorry.

00:07:34.380 --> 00:07:36.920
The sudden downpour threw me off guard.

00:07:36.990 --> 00:07:38.850
The seasons must be changing.

00:07:42.460 --> 00:07:45.060
You must have it tough, Ms. Goda.

00:07:45.890 --> 00:07:50.000
You only think of your students' future
and they still rebel.

00:07:50.200 --> 00:07:53.300
You must endure a lot as an educator.

00:07:53.740 --> 00:07:57.770
But, calling my son
a "nuisance" is going too far.

00:07:59.470 --> 00:08:01.040
<i>Her hearing is sharp.</i>

00:08:01.840 --> 00:08:05.010
Haruo spent a long time
searching for Akira

00:08:05.080 --> 00:08:07.780
with no clue as to where
she could've been.

00:08:08.580 --> 00:08:11.790
He's not someone who would act
with an ulterior motive.

00:08:12.220 --> 00:08:16.160
Of course, it's natural for every family
to raise their kids differently.

00:08:16.220 --> 00:08:19.530
But it's unreasonable
to put so many restrictions.

00:08:20.300 --> 00:08:24.700
I have no regrets letting my son
grow at his own pace.

00:08:25.770 --> 00:08:29.300
He's grown into
a considerate and good son.

00:08:29.900 --> 00:08:32.710
Please try to understand
the child, Ms. Goda,

00:08:32.970 --> 00:08:36.980
and raise her in a way you won't regret.

00:08:38.480 --> 00:08:40.780
I thank you for your advice.

00:08:41.020 --> 00:08:44.720
However, I will do things my own way.

00:08:48.160 --> 00:08:50.260
I'm glad the rain let up.

00:08:50.360 --> 00:08:52.060
I'll lend you this umbrella.

00:08:52.130 --> 00:08:53.960
-No, thank you.
-Please feel free.

00:08:54.030 --> 00:08:55.560
I don't want you to catch cold.

00:08:55.900 --> 00:08:58.430
My son can get the umbrella from you,

00:08:58.500 --> 00:09:00.770
or Akira can come return it.

00:09:01.400 --> 00:09:02.340
In that case...

00:09:06.310 --> 00:09:08.310
<i>Haruo, I got chills!</i>

00:09:08.410 --> 00:09:10.980
<i>Ms. Namie, you're the best!</i>

00:09:11.710 --> 00:09:14.150
<i>His mother is quite formidable.</i>

00:09:15.320 --> 00:09:19.220
Mom... I couldn't talk back
when she criticized me.

00:09:19.290 --> 00:09:20.420
Don't worry about it.

00:09:20.490 --> 00:09:23.890
There's no need for
a high school brat to talk back.

00:09:24.090 --> 00:09:26.690
You just do what you think is right.

00:09:27.400 --> 00:09:30.170
I'm glad I'm your son.

00:09:30.530 --> 00:09:33.570
So, you had your
year-end ceremony today, right?

00:09:33.640 --> 00:09:35.640
-Where's your report card?
-What?

00:09:35.700 --> 00:09:37.910
REPORT CARD

00:09:41.380 --> 00:09:43.980
<i>Nice! That was a good finish.</i>

00:09:56.990 --> 00:10:01.800
<i>Summer break is about to start,</i>
<i>so why do I feel so glum?</i>

00:10:02.330 --> 00:10:05.500
<i>When things don't feel right,</i>
<i>it's best to turn to Karateka.</i>

00:10:05.570 --> 00:10:07.000
<i>The gameplay is simple.</i>

00:10:09.140 --> 00:10:11.740
<i>Ugh! I forgot about Hidaka.</i>

00:10:11.910 --> 00:10:14.440
<i>I have to think about my match with her.</i>

00:10:14.580 --> 00:10:17.880
<i>And I have to go out with her if I lose?</i>
<i>What's up with that?</i>

00:10:18.350 --> 00:10:20.820
<i>I get it. I get it, but...</i>

00:10:20.920 --> 00:10:22.380
<i>I'll think about my oasis,</i>

00:10:22.450 --> 00:10:26.920
<i>going to the AOU Show at Makuhari Messe, </i>
<i>to calm myself.</i>

00:10:27.390 --> 00:10:29.560
<i>It's a wonderful show where game makers</i>

00:10:29.620 --> 00:10:32.290
<i>from the arcade industry </i>
<i>show their new hardware.</i>

00:10:32.360 --> 00:10:37.000
<i>And I hear if you pay the entrance fee,</i>
<i>you can play as many games as you want.</i>

00:10:37.730 --> 00:10:39.700
It's truly this era's crown jewel.

00:10:39.770 --> 00:10:42.840
<i>It'd be fun to go there with Ono...</i>

00:10:42.900 --> 00:10:45.270
<i>Don't get involved with her!</i>

00:10:45.510 --> 00:10:48.940
<i>Ah! What should I do? What can I do?</i>

00:10:49.540 --> 00:10:52.710
<i>And how do I get out of this trap?</i>

00:10:52.810 --> 00:10:54.180
I can't figure it out!

00:10:55.820 --> 00:10:56.680
Ziiya.

00:10:57.290 --> 00:10:59.820
-Yes?
-I found this in the car.

00:11:00.560 --> 00:11:05.160
You know games are prohibited in
the Ono Family, yet you gave this to her.

00:11:05.290 --> 00:11:07.560
Oh no, that's for my personal use--

00:11:07.630 --> 00:11:08.800
Do not lie to me!

00:11:09.130 --> 00:11:14.340
You clearly gave it to Miss Akira in
the car and thought no one would notice.

00:11:14.400 --> 00:11:16.000
There's no use denying it!

00:11:16.270 --> 00:11:20.880
Miss, open the drawer
in front of the seat.

00:11:24.150 --> 00:11:26.280
I should have realized much sooner,

00:11:26.410 --> 00:11:29.750
but in the car, you have
your own personal space.

00:11:30.150 --> 00:11:35.220
I bought it thinking even if you can't
play in your room, you could play here.

00:11:35.490 --> 00:11:40.030
<i>Fatal Fury Special, Samurai Shodown, </i>
<i>Puyo Puyo,</i> and <i>Space Harrier.</i>

00:11:40.160 --> 00:11:43.460
There's also a car adapter,
so you can play to your heart's content.

00:11:44.300 --> 00:11:46.200
I'm glad you like it.

00:11:46.330 --> 00:11:50.140
You need a break at times as well.

00:11:53.940 --> 00:11:57.910
You're playing <i>Mortal Kombat: </i>
<i>Shinken Kourin Densetsu,</i> aren't you?

00:11:58.050 --> 00:11:59.380
I can tell by the music.

00:11:59.810 --> 00:12:02.020
You've violated the rules.

00:12:02.080 --> 00:12:06.320
So you're relieved of your duties as
Miss Akira's personal driver right away.

00:12:06.390 --> 00:12:08.660
You will work in the house for now.

00:12:08.760 --> 00:12:11.430
Don't let something like this
happen ever again.

00:12:11.490 --> 00:12:14.330
Do not forget I have the power to fire you

00:12:14.400 --> 00:12:17.430
should I decide
you're a negative influence on her.

00:12:18.170 --> 00:12:19.630
It happened this afternoon.

00:12:20.100 --> 00:12:21.740
You didn't know, right?

00:12:21.800 --> 00:12:25.610
She's throwing around her useless power.
I hate that old hag!

00:12:26.370 --> 00:12:29.010
I feel bad for Ziiya. It's just a game.

00:12:29.080 --> 00:12:32.580
When I said I wanted a computer,
she refused me flat out.

00:12:32.950 --> 00:12:35.080
She thinks I want it
for lascivious reasons.

00:12:35.150 --> 00:12:38.520
She must be stupid.
That's not what I want it for!

00:12:38.620 --> 00:12:40.290
Well okay, maybe I do!

00:12:47.060 --> 00:12:48.200
Miss?

00:12:50.370 --> 00:12:53.670
Please don't blame yourself.

00:12:54.270 --> 00:12:57.940
I've only been temporarily
relieved of my duties.

00:12:58.140 --> 00:13:00.940
Besides, summer break has begun.

00:13:01.010 --> 00:13:04.150
You won't be need the car as much.

00:13:04.610 --> 00:13:09.780
I could be back to my duties
by the time summer is over.

00:13:10.220 --> 00:13:12.820
I'm certain the one taking my place,

00:13:12.890 --> 00:13:15.790
will be inflexible with no sense of humor.

00:13:16.820 --> 00:13:21.360
Miss, my duties as your personal driver
will end today,

00:13:21.530 --> 00:13:24.600
but would you like to go
for a drive with me?

00:13:24.700 --> 00:13:27.340
There's somewhere I'd like to stop by.

00:13:27.500 --> 00:13:29.340
Please keep it secret from Ms. Goda.

00:13:31.710 --> 00:13:33.710
Oh, mister dolphin...

00:13:33.910 --> 00:13:38.310
<i>This game called Aqua Note no Kyujitsu</i>
<i>really clears the mind...</i>

00:13:38.480 --> 00:13:42.150
<i>To think I can explore the underwater sea</i>
<i>in my own home...</i>

00:13:44.320 --> 00:13:46.650
<i>This is no time for me to escape reality!</i>

00:13:46.720 --> 00:13:49.590
<i>I need to face the things</i>
<i>that's been bothering me.</i>

00:13:50.460 --> 00:13:53.460
Haruo! Ziiya's here to see you!

00:13:53.530 --> 00:13:54.430
Huh, Ziiya?

00:13:55.630 --> 00:13:58.630
<i>Ono? Why is she here?</i>

00:14:08.110 --> 00:14:11.580
Go ahead and enjoy yourself. Go ahead!

00:14:11.650 --> 00:14:14.950
These pancakes are straight
out of a picture book.

00:14:15.020 --> 00:14:16.520
Looks caloric.

00:14:16.580 --> 00:14:20.920
Isn't there a festival nearby today?
Why don't you go?

00:14:21.020 --> 00:14:22.490
You can take Akira.

00:14:23.020 --> 00:14:25.830
Ziiya says he can pick you up later.

00:14:25.990 --> 00:14:29.600
We plan on gossiping about Moemi.

00:14:29.660 --> 00:14:31.200
<i>You're gonna badmouth her.</i>

00:14:31.830 --> 00:14:33.530
Young Master Haruo,

00:14:33.670 --> 00:14:37.110
I'd like to talk to you
before you head out.

00:14:42.610 --> 00:14:45.180
What? Why do you keep staring at me?

00:14:50.450 --> 00:14:53.350
Ow, ow! What the heck are you doing?

00:14:53.860 --> 00:14:54.790
Hey!

00:14:55.460 --> 00:14:58.260
Stop that! My back is sensitive.

00:14:58.390 --> 00:15:01.260
You're in high school now.
You're not a kid anymore.

00:15:01.330 --> 00:15:04.270
Are you saying you don't know
how to act around me?

00:15:05.130 --> 00:15:06.630
Hey, I saw that smile.

00:15:06.700 --> 00:15:08.740
That was a devilish smile.

00:15:11.740 --> 00:15:13.510
Oh, there it is.

00:15:13.570 --> 00:15:15.180
This definitely feels like summer.

00:15:15.510 --> 00:15:16.940
Makes my heart leap.

00:15:17.850 --> 00:15:22.080
But that said, our destination is
the Marumiya Arcade.

00:15:23.050 --> 00:15:26.090
I rarely get the chance to come
to the arcade with you.

00:15:26.150 --> 00:15:29.790
CHINA GATE

00:15:30.120 --> 00:15:33.530
<i>As expected of Ono. </i>
<i>She's even familiar with</i><i>China Gate.</i>

00:15:33.930 --> 00:15:39.270
<i>I could tell from the evil-looking </i>
<i>characters, this game would be good.</i>

00:15:39.500 --> 00:15:43.540
<i>She's effectively using the jump attacks.</i>

00:15:44.210 --> 00:15:48.540
<i>How many women in this world</i>
<i>are good at playing China Gate?</i>

00:15:48.940 --> 00:15:53.050
There haven't been as many
creepy-looking games like this lately.

00:15:53.710 --> 00:15:54.880
Fighting games are great,

00:15:54.950 --> 00:15:57.790
but they should come out
with more weird games.

00:16:15.070 --> 00:16:16.940
This just tickles me.

00:16:17.000 --> 00:16:20.710
I can't help but grin seeing this
final boss go through its transformations.

00:16:21.880 --> 00:16:25.910
It's been a while since
we cleared a game together.

00:16:26.350 --> 00:16:30.790
I'm glad we can enjoy a world like this.
We've got good taste.

00:16:33.150 --> 00:16:36.560
<i>It's been a while</i>
<i>since we saw Haruo so animated.</i>

00:16:36.620 --> 00:16:39.330
<i>He's been troubled lately.</i>

00:16:39.430 --> 00:16:41.630
<i>She's like medicine to him.</i>

00:16:41.700 --> 00:16:44.630
<i>Their relationship is so frustrating!</i>

00:16:52.340 --> 00:16:54.180
<i>She's good at everything she does!</i>

00:16:54.240 --> 00:16:57.780
<i>She pouts at first </i>
<i>but immediately gets better.</i>

00:16:57.910 --> 00:16:59.480
<i>It's refreshing just watching her.</i>

00:17:00.050 --> 00:17:04.690
<i>Everyday would be so fun</i>
<i>if we lived together in an arcade.</i>

00:17:04.850 --> 00:17:07.820
<i>Haruo, your idea is too far out...</i>

00:17:08.290 --> 00:17:09.460
Drop him! Drop him!

00:17:09.820 --> 00:17:12.460
Smash all the bosses on screen!

00:17:18.570 --> 00:17:21.040
No, don't let it bother you.

00:17:24.470 --> 00:17:27.010
<i>She's being unusually demure.</i>

00:17:28.080 --> 00:17:31.150
Oh, they're getting pumped
over <i>Virtua Fighter 2.1.</i>

00:17:31.750 --> 00:17:34.620
Even more precise than <i>Virtua Fighter 2.</i>

00:17:34.680 --> 00:17:36.650
The fighting game boom
is still going strong.

00:17:36.980 --> 00:17:40.490
I love that feeling
when a new game gets installed.

00:17:40.560 --> 00:17:42.890
Everyone gets antsy and less talkative.

00:17:45.460 --> 00:17:47.500
<i>I knew Ono would choose Wolf.</i>

00:17:47.630 --> 00:17:50.130
<i>She likes big characters with throw moves.</i>

00:17:54.900 --> 00:17:58.710
<i>I thought she was being demure,</i>
<i>but look at her go wild now.</i>

00:18:00.140 --> 00:18:01.580
<i>It's just like her.</i>

00:18:04.550 --> 00:18:07.280
This summer break will be exciting.

00:18:07.420 --> 00:18:09.120
<i>Tekken 2 </i>is coming out.

00:18:09.380 --> 00:18:11.390
Things are going to get busy.

00:18:11.690 --> 00:18:14.020
This was a nice diversion, right?

00:18:15.360 --> 00:18:17.730
Are you satisfied, my lady?

00:18:18.590 --> 00:18:21.460
Is that a grumpy face I'm seeing?

00:18:21.530 --> 00:18:24.370
I take it my lady is far from satisfied.

00:18:24.530 --> 00:18:27.370
The games should satisfy you,
but you've still got that look.

00:18:27.440 --> 00:18:30.740
That means you're unsatisfied
with something else.

00:18:31.070 --> 00:18:32.670
I can only think of one thing.

00:18:32.740 --> 00:18:34.340
That's right, hunger!

00:18:34.440 --> 00:18:37.480
This is a manifestation
of unsatisfied hunger.

00:18:37.550 --> 00:18:41.050
It's an expression that combines sadness
and anger born of hunger!

00:18:41.120 --> 00:18:45.450
An expression that says,
"Give me food." No, "Feed me, damn it!"

00:18:51.590 --> 00:18:54.730
You haven't changed,
you're easy to read as always.

00:18:55.300 --> 00:18:56.360
And a glutton as always.

00:18:57.900 --> 00:19:02.200
<i>All the games and food</i>
<i>seem too good to be true.</i>

00:19:02.470 --> 00:19:03.300
<i>Oh, well.</i>

00:19:03.740 --> 00:19:07.270
<i>When I look at her, none of that matters.</i>

00:19:11.250 --> 00:19:15.750
<i>Young Master Haruo.</i>
<i>I'd like to talk to you a little.</i>

00:19:16.750 --> 00:19:22.090
<i>I've worked as a personal driver </i>
<i>for the Miss since she was six years old.</i>

00:19:22.460 --> 00:19:27.330
<i>Every day, I'd press the accelerator</i>
<i>and watched over her as she grew.</i>

00:19:27.530 --> 00:19:31.000
<i>I take pride in my work.</i>

00:19:31.470 --> 00:19:36.270
<i>However, today will be </i>
<i>the last day of my job.</i>

00:19:37.470 --> 00:19:41.040
<i>Her schooling is going to become</i>
<i>even more strict.</i>

00:19:41.240 --> 00:19:46.050
<i>The new driver will be someone loyal </i>
<i>to the family's rules.</i>

00:19:46.180 --> 00:19:49.580
<i>In other words, Haruo,</i>
<i>she'll be robbed of</i>

00:19:49.650 --> 00:19:52.950
<i>nearly any chance to meet with you.</i>

00:19:53.450 --> 00:19:57.220
This will be that last moment
I can give to her.

00:19:57.690 --> 00:20:01.560
I wanted her to spend that time with you.

00:20:01.730 --> 00:20:02.900
That can't be...

00:20:03.000 --> 00:20:08.400
Young Master Haruo, please be
the Miss's emotional support,

00:20:08.900 --> 00:20:10.500
even if it's just for today.

00:20:10.570 --> 00:20:11.410
Ziiya...

00:20:12.440 --> 00:20:16.510
Oh! You went for last year's FFVI!

00:20:16.580 --> 00:20:18.210
Tell me it ain't so!

00:20:19.980 --> 00:20:23.520
No way! There's no way you can get that!

00:20:25.950 --> 00:20:29.160
See? I told you!
That's what you get for being greedy.

00:20:29.220 --> 00:20:30.860
You gluttonous woman!

00:20:33.960 --> 00:20:37.900
I've never seen anyone win
such a fancy prize before.

00:20:38.000 --> 00:20:39.170
I'm impressed.

00:20:39.400 --> 00:20:41.200
What? You're giving it to me?

00:20:41.670 --> 00:20:44.510
Right, you don't have a console.

00:20:44.640 --> 00:20:46.740
You can come over to play next time.

00:20:53.080 --> 00:20:55.080
<i>Will there even be a next time?</i>

00:20:56.420 --> 00:20:57.820
Want some cotton candy?

00:20:59.320 --> 00:21:01.690
<i>We'll be apart again.</i>

00:21:01.890 --> 00:21:04.790
<i>How many times have we </i>
<i>been separated already?</i>

00:21:05.290 --> 00:21:07.560
<i>It could be more than a separation...</i>

00:21:09.530 --> 00:21:11.770
<i>This might be the last time...</i>

00:21:25.110 --> 00:21:27.350
You've got a really cute face, Ono.

00:21:40.060 --> 00:21:43.500
Oh, it's Ziiya's car.
Guess we've made him wait.

00:21:46.830 --> 00:21:48.370
Well, take care...

00:21:49.070 --> 00:21:51.410
Don't let Ms. Moemi Goda get to you.

00:24:03.570 --> 00:24:05.970
Subtitle translation by Emily Noguchi

00:24:11.010 --> 00:24:13.910
<i>My life is over if I guard</i>
<i>against one projectile,</i>

00:24:14.050 --> 00:24:16.120
<i>but the opponent</i>
<i>has more than half left.</i>

00:24:16.180 --> 00:24:19.190
<i>But in that moment, </i>
<i>my senses are sharpened,</i>

00:24:19.250 --> 00:24:22.220
<i>and I can dodge any attack </i>
<i>to defeat my opponent!</i>

00:24:22.290 --> 00:24:24.290
<i>Miracles like that can happen.</i>
